  + [F-12] projection invents path, mode, digest, or ordinal
  + [F-13] dependency, unsafe, platform call, or runtime effect appears
  + [F-14] structural result is cited as physical, fresh, complete, trusted, or same-handle evidence
  + [F-15] prerequisite authority becomes stale

