& [SemanticRefinementTrace] is exact
  + [supplied] means caller-constructed syntax, not observed, authenticated, trusted, or fresh
  + [correlated] means nonzero identifiers compare equal, not same handle, object, query, or time
  + [structurally_complete] means every required variant is present, not that a platform query completed
  + [coherent] means declared fields satisfy this deterministic profile, not that they describe reality
  + [projection] means a lossy derived seed with explicit omissions, not a TopologyEntryObservation
  + [explicit_empty] means caller supplied the empty variant, not that Windows proved no streams

& [ConstraintCheckTrace] is grounded
  + [source] requires five supplied record classes, cross-field coherence, no defaults, and explicit nonclaims
  + [readiness] requires an epoch-bound pure composition seam before any physical adapter
  + [entry_policy] accepts exact caller-supplied values and returns no physical fact
  + [stream_parser] exposes public raw records whose constructor bypass requires assembly revalidation
  + [machine_forms] require sorted stream facts and additional path, mode, digest, and ordinal facts not present here
  + [framework] requires governing protocol ad10f10f-d506-48ef-a805-f8b0a133766c and evidence for every processed stage

